1	option	What do you need assistance with?
2	line	Player	What do you need assistance with?
2	line	Thormac	I've lost my pet scorpions. They're lesser Kharid scorpions, a very rare breed.
2	line	Thormac	I left their cage door open, now I don't know where they've gone.
2	line	Thormac	There's three of them, and they're quick little beasties. They're all over Gielinor.
2	line	Player	How would I go about catching them?
2	line	Thormac	Well I have a scorpion cage here which you can use to catch them in.
2	line	Thormac	If you go up to the village of Seers, to the North of here, one of them will be able to tell you where the scorpions are now.
2	select	Start the Scorpion Catcher quest?
2	option	Yes.
3	line	Player	Okay, I will do it then.
3	action	end
